       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CSCUSTRPT.
      *****************************************************************
      * CSS REPORT - PRINTS A CUSTOMER LINE FROM A RECORD ANOTHER    *
      * MODULE ALREADY FETCHED (PASSED IN THROUGH THE COMMON AREA).  *
      * NOTHING IN ITS OWN SOURCE BINDS A COLUMN, BUT IT COPIES      *
      * CSCUST AND CSWORK, SO A WIDENED LAYOUT FORCES A REBUILD.     *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE CSCUST END-EXEC.
           COPY CSWORK.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE CS-CUST-ID      TO CS-RL-CUST-ID
           MOVE CS-CUST-NAME    TO CS-RL-NAME
           MOVE CS-CUST-BALANCE TO CS-RL-BALANCE
           DISPLAY CS-RL-FLAT
           STOP RUN.
